        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "On weekends, 15-year-old Mateo Lange "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "sorts",
            "ref": "v-sort"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " bottles and cans in his hometown of Indian River, Michigan. He runs a recycling program to help his "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "community",
            "ref": "v-community"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Mateo started the program in 2020. He was a baseball player with the Northern Michigan Cyclones. His team needed money for competitions, so Mateo "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "came up with",
            "ref": "v-come-up-with"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " a plan."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "He noticed many empty cans and bottles on the streets. In Michigan, people can return these for money. Mateo and his father organized a bottle and can "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "drive",
            "ref": "v-drive"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". They raised $7,500—much more than expected. We made so much money, Mateo thought. Why don’t we keep this going?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Since then, his program has collected over two million bottles and cans. It has helped keep his hometown clean and raised $350,000. The money has supported at least fifty youth groups."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Sometimes people had trouble returning bottles. So Mateo and his dad started a "
          },
          {
            "t": "underline",
            "v": "pickup service"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Mateo used his grandpa’s truck to collect bottles from homes. He would knock on doors and say, “I’m here to pick up.” People gladly gave him their bottles. Then he and his dad sorted them and took them to recycling plants."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Mateo’s idea not only helped the environment but also brought people together."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
